rn them-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنْ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"35:23"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"you (are)","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"35:23"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"35:23"},{"pos":4,"ar":"نَذِيرٌ","en_gloss":"a warner","transliteration":"nadhīrun","verse_key":"35:23"},{"pos":5,"ar":"٢٣","en_gloss":"(23)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:23"}]},{"verse_key":"35:24","surah":35,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّآ أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ بِٱلْحَقِّ بَشِيرًا وَنَذِيرًا ۚ وَإِن مِّنْ أُمَّةٍ إِلَّا خَلَا فِيهَا نَذِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have sent you with the Truth as a bearer of good news and warning- every community has been sent a warner.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّآ","en_gloss":"Indeed, We","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَرْسَلْنَـٰكَ","en_gloss":"[We] have sent you","transliteration":"arsalnāka","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"with the truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بَشِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"(as) a bearer of glad tidings","transliteration":"bashīran","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَنَذِيرًۭا ۚ","en_gloss":"and (as) a warner","transliteration":"wanadhīran","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"(was) any","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أُمَّةٍ","en_gloss":"nation","transliteration":"ummatin","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"خَلَا","en_gloss":"had passed","transliteration":"khalā","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"within it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَذِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a warner","transliteration":"nadhīrun","verse_key":"35:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:24"}]},{"verse_key":"35:25","surah":35,"ayah":25,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن يُكَذِّبُوكَ فَقَدْ كَذَّبَ ٱلَّذِينَ مِن قَبْلِهِمْ جَآءَتْهُمْ رُسُلُهُم بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ وَبِٱلزُّبُرِ وَبِٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ٱلْمُنِيرِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If they call you a liar, their predecessors did the same: messengers came to them with clear signs, scriptures, and enlightening revelation","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُكَذِّبُوكَ","en_gloss":"they deny you","transliteration":"yukadhibūka","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَقَدْ","en_gloss":"then certainly","transliteration":"faqad","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَذَّبَ","en_gloss":"denied","transliteration":"kadhaba","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَبْلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"(were) before them","transliteration":"qablihim","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":8,"ar":"جَآءَتْهُمْ","en_gloss":"Came to them","transliteration":"jāathum","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رُسُلُهُم","en_gloss":"their Messengers","transliteration":"rusuluhum","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"with clear signs","transliteration":"bil-bayināti","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَبِٱلزُّبُرِ","en_gloss":"and with Scriptures","transliteration":"wabil-zuburi","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَبِٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","en_gloss":"and with the Book","transliteration":"wabil-kitābi","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْمُنِيرِ","en_gloss":"[the] enlightening","transliteration":"l-munīri","verse_key":"35:25"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢٥","en_gloss":"(25)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:25"}]},{"verse_key":"35:26","surah":35,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"ثُمَّ أَخَذْتُ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ ۖ فَكَيْفَ كَانَ نَكِيرِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"and afterwards I seized the disbelievers- how terrible My punishment was!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"35:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَخَذْتُ","en_gloss":"I seized","transliteration":"akhadhtu","verse_key":"35:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"35:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟ ۖ","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"35:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَكَيْفَ","en_gloss":"and how","transliteration":"fakayfa","verse_key":"35:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"35:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"نَكِيرِ","en_gloss":"My rejection","transliteration":"nakīri","verse_key":"35:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٢٦","en_gloss":"(26)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:26"}]},{"verse_key":"35:27","surah":35,"ayah":27,"ar_uthmani":"أَلَمْ تَرَ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ أَنزَلَ مِنَ ٱلسَّمَآءِ مَآءً فَأَخْرَجْنَا بِهِۦ ثَمَرَٰتٍ مُّخْتَلِفًا أَلْوَٰنُهَا ۚ وَمِنَ ٱلْجِبَالِ جُدَدٌۢ بِيضٌ وَحُمْرٌ مُّخْتَلِفٌ أَلْوَٰنُهَا وَغَرَابِيبُ سُودٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Have you [Prophet] not considered how God sends water down from the sky and that We produce with it fruits of varied colours; that there are in the mountains layers of white and red of various hues, and jet black;","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَلَمْ","en_gloss":"Do not","transliteration":"alam","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَرَ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tara","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"sends down","transliteration":"anzala","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","en_gloss":"the sky","transliteration":"l-samāi","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"māan","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَأَخْرَجْنَا","en_gloss":"then We bring forth","transliteration":"fa-akhrajnā","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"therewith","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثَمَرَٰتٍۢ","en_gloss":"fruits","transliteration":"thamarātin","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مُّخْتَلِفًا","en_gloss":"(of) various","transliteration":"mukh'talifan","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَلْوَٰنُهَا ۚ","en_gloss":"[their] colors","transliteration":"alwānuhā","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَمِنَ","en_gloss":"And in","transliteration":"wamina","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱلْجِبَالِ","en_gloss":"the mountains","transliteration":"l-jibāli","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":16,"ar":"جُدَدٌۢ","en_gloss":"(are) tracts","transliteration":"judadun","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بِيضٌۭ","en_gloss":"white","transliteration":"bīḍun","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَحُمْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"and red","transliteration":"waḥum'run","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":19,"ar":"مُّخْتَلِفٌ","en_gloss":"(of) various","transliteration":"mukh'talifun","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَلْوَٰنُهَا","en_gloss":"[their] colors","transliteration":"alwānuhā","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَغَرَابِيبُ","en_gloss":"and intensely black","transliteration":"wagharābību","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":22,"ar":"سُودٌۭ","en_gloss":"and intensely black","transliteration":"sūdun","verse_key":"35:27"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٢٧","en_gloss":"(27)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"35:27"}]},{"verse_key":"35:28","surah":35,"ayah":28,"ar_uthmani":"وَمِنَ ٱلنَّاسِ وَٱلدَّوَآبِّ وَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ مُخْتَلِفٌ أَلْوَٰنُهُۥ كَذَٰلِكَ ۗ إِنَّمَا يَخْشَى ٱللَّهَ مِنْ عِبَادِهِ ٱلْعُلَمَـٰٓؤُا۟ ۗ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ عَزِيزٌ غَفُورٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"that there are various colours among human beings, wild animals, and livestock too? It is those of His servants who have knowledge who st